 "description": "The QASM Cryptographic Module is a high-assurance, tamper-resistant Hardware Security Module (HSM) which secures sensitive data and critical applications by storing, protecting and managing cryptographic keys. It provides end users with industry-leading security and performance. The QASM can be embedded into the QxEDGE family of security appliances for FIPS 140-2 validated key security or be used as a standalone co-processor for an external computing system using a docking-station adapter.",
